{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buckle Up!</strong> is a 2\u20136 player online party shooter where quick matches and unpredictable moments keep everyone on their toes. Jump into fast-paced rounds with friends or strangers, switch up your strategy on the fly, and try not to fall off the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match brings a new challenge, with different gamemodes, weapons to upgrade, and plenty of ways to mess with your opponents. Win by scoring points, outplaying your rivals, or just staying on board a little longer than everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/Title1.png?t=1744384334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/NewMultiplayerGif1.gif?t=1744384334\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the chaos with up to 6 players in online multiplayer. Play with friends or find new rivals in public lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/Title2.png?t=1744384334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/NewGamemodesGif.gif?t=1744384334\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're stealing flags, holding hills, dodging players with bombs, or just going full deathmatch, there's always a new way to win or lose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/Title3.png?t=1744384334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/GunScreenGIf.gif?t=1744384334\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect upgrades for your weapons mid-match. Adapt on the fly with special weapons and game-changing pickups then unleash chaos on your competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/Title4.png?t=1744384334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/NewCompeteGif.gif?t=1744384334\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outplay your friends, grab the high score, and fight for the top spot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/Title5.png?t=1744384334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/CosmeticsGIf.gif?t=1744384334\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your personality with customizable outfits and characters. From stylish to downright ridiculous.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620720?t=1744384334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620720?t=1744384334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/4d3e8f9d18fa9c762a2d4482d01f0d8d3932d49e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744384334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/4d3e8f9d18fa9c762a2d4482d01f0d8d3932d49e/cap